        "description": "Real HTTP Gateway Service Benchmark: Uvicorn ASGI behind NGINX Reverse Proxy over local loopback interface (127.0.0.1:8080 -> 127.0.0.1:8000). A separate load generator process (wrk) evaluates high-concurrency throughput and latency percentiles (p50, p95, p99) across 10 repeated runs split by:\n  1. no_inspection (pure passthrough baseline)\n  2. benign_fast_path (Tier 1 edge screening wire-speed requests)\n  3. escalated (uncertain payloads routed to Tier 2 deep verification)\n  4. two_tier_blended (realistic mixed traffic stream with 10% escalation)\nValidates theoretical blended latency against measured end-to-end latency and verifies the throughput invariant: throughput(no_inspection) >= throughput(two_tier).\n",
